cff-version: 1.2.0
title: AI Battery
message: If you reference AI Battery in writing, software or research, please cite it using these metadata.
type: software
authors:
  - alias: KyleNesium
    website: https://github.com/KyleNesium
abstract: >-
  AI Battery is a free, open-source macOS menu bar app that shows rate limits,
  context health and token usage for Claude Code and OpenAI Codex, for up to
  three accounts per provider. It reads local session logs for token counts and
  context-window fullness, never message content, and makes minimal requests to
  the provider for rate limits. No analytics, no telemetry.
repository-code: https://github.com/KyleNesium/AIBattery
url: https://aibattery.dev
repository-artifact: https://github.com/KyleNesium/AIBattery/releases
license: MIT
version: 3.4.0
date-released: '2026-11-03'
